speechtext:
1.	How many persons were called for their medical examination under the mobilization act, (a) during the month of January, 1944;
(b)	during the month of February, 1944; (c) from March 1 to March 15, 1944?
2.	How many persons received a notice to report for military training under the mobilization act, (a) during the month of January, 1944; (b) during the month of February, 1944;
(c)	from March 1 to March 15, 1944?
